# Compiled example programs.
#
# `go build ./examples/native-window/` writes its binary into the directory it
# is run from, which is the repository root, not next to the source. Three such
# binaries were committed before this pattern was right, so match the names
# rather than a path under examples/.
/native-window
/web-window
/tray-only
/full-shell

# Snapshot comparisons a failing render writes beside its reference.
*.actual.png

# Go build and test output
*.exe
*.wasm
*.test
*.out

# macOS
.DS_Store
